{"id":"wb-8-444","name":"天峰山古建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"天峰山古建筑群","text":"天峰山古建筑群位于云南省大理州祥云县普淜镇天峰山山顶，是滇西道教正一派的重要道场。始建于明万历年间，历代曾多次修建，建筑群规模较大，依山势布局，石雕、木雕和彩绘颇具彝族地方建筑特色。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A9%E5%B3%B0%E5%B1%B1%E5%8F%A4%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":91759929,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91759929","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d1b2b9d97ade63169f3dd95c.jpg","title":"天峰山_老君殿_2025-07-15_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%A4%A9%E5%B3%B0%E5%B1%B1_%E8%80%81%E5%90%9B%E6%AE%BF_2025-07-15_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/74/%E5%A4%A9%E5%B3%B0%E5%B1%B1_%E8%80%81%E5%90%9B%E6%AE%BF_2025-07-15_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Kcx36","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​天峰山 老君殿","width":320,"height":213}}